                                                "sense_id": "febf9a88-ba13-38a1-9100-86ce7a8f8e4e",
                                                "text": "First of all, she's probably the most popular politics-adjacent figure in the country. She's not a politician. She's never run for anything, but I have said for a long time – I think we all agree – if she did ever want to run for something, she would be right at the front of the line."
